  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Boosting Equal Learning Opportunities - WeLearn</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;b&gt;The WeLearn project&lt;/b&gt;, Boosting Equal Learning Opportunities, aims to ensure the right to safe and quality education and health care for vulnerable groups including children, girls and women, and refugees.     Results will be achieved through three pathways aiming at improving access to and successful completion of four years of quality lower secondary education.</narrative>
  </description>
